[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0026","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-47423","title":"Personal Weather Station Dashboard 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Personal Weather Station Dashboard 12_lts 版本存在路径遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /others/_test.php 发送特制的 test 参数（如 ../../../apache/conf/ssl.key/server.key）实现目录遍历，从而读取服务器任意文件，包括以明文方式泄露服务端 SSL 私钥等敏感信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。建议升级至最新版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-47423"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-05-07T18:15:43.393","updated":"2026-06-17T09:28:06.057","remediation":"升级 PWS Dashboard 至 12_lts 之后的安全版本；如无补丁，立即删除或禁用 `/others/_test.php` 文件；在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面添加规则，拦截包含 `../` 的 `test` 参数请求；限制 Web 进程对敏感目录（如 `/etc`、SSL 密钥目录）的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/haluka92/CVE-2025-47423","https://pwsdashboard.com/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-47423.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-47423.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-47423.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-47423.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-47423-Haluka92_CVE-2025-47423.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-47423/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-47423.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/47xxx/CVE-2025-47423.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2025-47423.yaml","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/333a12945888842887b9d7f35a124feef86df7c3/docs/2025/pws_pws-dashboard-%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-cve-2025-47423.toml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/57b2f46f8b4a48cfba3cb8b60306b43a8ab2b242/2025/47xxx/CVE-2025-47423.json","https://github.com/Haluka92/CVE-2025-47423","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-47423"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0006","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-46719","title":"Open WebUI 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一个自托管的人工智能平台，在 0.6.6 版本之前存在存储型跨站脚本漏洞。攻击者可在聊天消息中插入未转义的 HTML 标签和恶意 JavaScript 代码，当其他用户打开包含恶意代码的聊天记录时，脚本会在受害者浏览器中执行，窃取访问令牌从而完全控制受害者账户。若受害者是管理员，攻击者可进一步创建恶意 Python 函数实现服务器端远程代码执行。此外，该漏洞可通过社区共享功能实现跨用户传播，危害范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-46719","GHSA-9f4f-jv96-8766"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-05-05T19:15:57.197","updated":"2026-06-17T09:26:52.230","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.6.6 或以上版本，该版本已对 HTML 标签进行正确转义以防御 XSS。如无法立即升级，建议在管理面板中关闭「Enable Community Sharing」功能，并禁止用户分享聊天记录以降低攻击面。临时缓解措施还可配置 WAF 规则过滤聊天消息中的恶意 HTML/JavaScript 载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/main/src/lib/components/chat/Messages/Markdown/MarkdownTokens.svelte#L269-L279","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/6fd082d55ffaf6eb226efdeebc7155e3693d2d01","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-9f4f-jv96-8766","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2025/CVE-2025-46719.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/e00b340019f3b31282b4417e15c49f027f0909d3/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2025-46719.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/928db9679b69032a137f1c2f3374c28367145ef0/cves/2025/46xxx/CVE-2025-46719.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/c78813392a686be9ed8245543249abb80331d014/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2025-46719.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/90bd0a835ff7ed8cfea0a199ea9e2f05e33d6c81/2025/46xxx/CVE-2025-46719.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/b705b33e466c706c1129370e07ab2e4166c35b4c/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-46719.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3d0187a2ae2380c20a24da45e4f13e8bdd980484/vulns/open-webui/PYSEC-2026-2716.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6ced4f7862026f4207c9708deb4edf129c83fc5/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-46719.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f6129ff19f955337f9f194ea8d5a3937dce9acb8/content/recipes/cve/cve-2025-46719-open-webui-vulnerable-to-stored-xss-via-unescaped-markdown-token-in-markdowntokens-svelte-leading-to-full-acco.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/be80f241080dc6ff384600eeed4a5579a42f2524/api/intel/products/cve-2025-46719-pip-open-webui.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0006.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0005","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-46571","title":"Open WebUI 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI（自托管AI平台）存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞，CWE-79分类。低权限用户可通过`/api/v1/files/`接口上传包含恶意JavaScript代码的HTML文件，服务器返回文件ID后，攻击者可构造链接诱导管理员点击，从而劫持管理员账户，进而利用管理员权限通过平台功能实现远程代码执行。默认配置下低权限用户上传的文件仅管理员或上传者自身可查看，限制了攻击面但未消除风险。该漏洞影响0.6.6之前版本，CVSS评分5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-46571","GHSA-8gh5-qqh8-hq3x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-05-05T19:15:57.050","updated":"2026-06-17T09:26:38.630","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.6.6 及以上版本（官方已修复文件上传 XSS 漏洞）。如暂无法升级，可在反向代理层限制 `/api/v1/files/` 端点的上传文件类型，禁止上传 `.html` 后缀文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/main/backend/open_webui/routers/files.py#L434-L438","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/ef2aeb7c0eb976bac759e59ac359c94a5b8dc7e0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-8gh5-qqh8-hq3x"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0005.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0336","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0336.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-4293","title":"MRCMS 3.1.3 后台管理组编辑页面存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MRCMS 3.1.3 版本的后台管理组编辑接口 /admin/group/edit.do 存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。具有管理员权限的攻击者可在组名称等字段中注入恶意脚本代码，当其他管理员访问管理组页面时脚本自动执行，导致敏感信息泄露、页面内容篡改或恶意软件传播。攻击者需具备后台登录权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-4293","HWPOC-2025-05ca7d16"],"sources":["cve","github"],"published":"2025-05-05","updated":"2026-06-17","remediation":"厂商尚未发布官方补丁。建议升级至 MRCMS 最新版本，对用户输入进行严格的 HTML 实体编码和过滤，实施内容安全策略（CSP）限制脚本执行，并限制后台管理组页面的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bdkuzma/vuln/issues/2","https://vuldb.com/?id.307400","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-4293"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/bdkuzma/vuln/issues/2"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0336.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0072","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0072","title":"Arm Valhall/5th Gen GPU 内核驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Arm Ltd Valhall GPU Kernel Driver 及 Arm 5th Gen GPU Architecture Kernel Driver 存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。本地低权限用户进程通过不当 GPU 内存处理操作访问已释放内存，可导致敏感信息泄露和权限提升，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0072"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-05-02","updated":"2026-06-17","remediation":"将 Valhall GPU Kernel Driver 升级至 r49p4（r29p0-r49p3 分支）或 r54p0（r50p0-r53p0 分支）；将 Arm 5th Gen GPU Architecture Kernel Driver 升级至 r49p4（r41p0-r49p3 分支）或 r54p0（r50p0-r53p0 分支）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T13:06:00Z","references":["https://developer.arm.com/documentation/110465/latest/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0012","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2070","title":"联想 FileZ 客户端不当XML解析任意文件读取漏洞","description":"联想 FileZ（联想网盘）客户端存在 XML 外部实体（XXE）解析不当漏洞（CWE-611）。本地低权限用户若访问攻击者构造的恶意 URL，客户端在解析相关 XML 时可能被诱导读取系统任意文件，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击需本地条件并依赖用户交互（访问特制链接），不影响完整性与可用性。受影响版本为 FileZ Client 11.0.0.10 之前，CVSS 约 5.0–5.1（中危）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2070"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-25T16:15:26.180","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:14.800","remediation":"立即将联想网盘 FileZ 客户端升级至 11.0.0.10 或更高版本以修复不当 XML 解析（XXE）问题。升级前请从官方渠道下载安装包并关闭正在运行的 FileZ 客户端。若暂时无法升级，应避免打开未知或不可信链接，限制低权限本地用户访问 FileZ，并在企业环境中通过应用管控禁止运行受影响旧版本客户端作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.filez.com/securityPolicy/2.html?1744703100","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/431324351d69005e5e9ea9d116dc965ce92ed482/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2070.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-20701.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2070.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/2025/CVE-2025-20700.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-2025-2070.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2025/%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3_%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3%E7%BD%91%E7%9B%98filez-cve-2025-2070-%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96.toml","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-2070.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2070.json","https://github.com/auracast-research/race-toolkit/blob/eec737d3cef3f6155c513c05eddadb07ee8e9197/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2025/04/GHSA-58xr-825m-v3pq/GHSA-58xr-825m-v3pq.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-2070"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0011","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2069","title":"联想 FileZ 客户端 跨站脚本代码执行漏洞","description":"联想网盘FileZ客户端存在跨站脚本漏洞。该漏洞源于应用程序未对用户访问的链接进行充分的安全验证与内容过滤，攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的特制URL。当本地用户访问该恶意链接时，恶意代码将在客户端上下文中执行，可能导致用户数据泄露或远程代码执行。漏洞利用需用户主动点击攻击者提供的链接，成功利用后可进一步获取系统权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2069"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-25T16:15:26.020","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:14.687","remediation":"立即将联想 FileZ 客户端升级至联想官方发布的修复版本（请通过 FileZ 客户端内置更新或联想官网下载最新版）。在无法立即升级时，应避免点击来源不明的链接，并在企业网络出口处启用 Web 过滤与 XSS 防护策略作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.filez.com/securityPolicy/2.html?1744703100","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-2069.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2069.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2069.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2025/%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3_%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3%E7%BD%91%E7%9B%98filez-cve-2025-2069-%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2069.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-2069.html","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-20697.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-2025-20690.json","https://github.com/youngrichu/frp-freedom/blob/9eae82725ec6cc64950e34e505e7a03b39bbc4f9/FRP%20Bypass%20Methods%20research.md","https://github.com/mengyuqiao/LLM-Cyberteam/blob/acc4763d4f71f272105dcd08ef139cbc385a4976/crawl/extracted_cve_ids.txt","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-2069"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0010","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2068","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":11095,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":11115}}","description":"联想网盘 FileZ 客户端存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601）。该漏洞源于客户端对外部传入的 URL 校验不严格，未能正确验证重定向目标的合法性。当本地用户在终端上访问攻击者精心构造的恶意链接时，客户端会将其重定向至攻击者控制的外部站点，进而可能诱导用户泄露会话凭证、身份令牌或其他敏感信息。攻击需目标系统本地用户主动点击或访问特制 URL 方可触发，利用门槛较低但需用户交互。该漏洞影响使用存在缺陷版本 FileZ 客户端的联想网盘用户，CVSS 评分为 5.1，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2068"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-25T16:15:25.857","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:14.577","remediation":"建议立即将联想 FileZ 客户端升级至联想官方发布的最新安全版本（参考 Lenovo 安全公告 Lenovo Security Advisory），并在升级前避免点击来历不明的链接、仅通过官方或可信域名访问网盘。企业管理员可在网络出口防火墙/代理层对 FileZ 相关域名的重定向目标做白名单校验，禁止跳转到非可信第三方域名，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.filez.com/securityPolicy/2.html?1744703100","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2068.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-20682.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2068.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-2025-2068.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-2068.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3d905f6009ce1a0cb55b6b90198454d955586615/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2068.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2025/04/GHSA-6mpj-6mgp-p7v6/GHSA-6mpj-6mgp-p7v6.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-2025-20684.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a1842787-ca71-472f-9c65-8d32e3f9112a.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-20687.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-2068"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0055","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-32433","title":"Erlang/OTP SSH 预认证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Erlang/OTP SSH 实现中存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-306），由于 SSH 协议消息处理存在缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 SSH 服务器发送特制的协议消息触发该漏洞，在无需有效凭据的情况下绕过认证并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 OTP-27.3.3、OTP-26.2.5.11 及 OTP-25.3.2.20 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议用户立即升级至修复版本或通过防火墙限制 SSH 访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-32433"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-16T22:15:14.373","updated":"2026-06-17T09:11:59.137","remediation":"立即升级 Erlang/OTP 至安全版本：OTP-27.3.3、OTP-26.2.5.11 或 OTP-25.3.2.20。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或网络层面禁用 SSH 服务对外暴露，仅允许受信 IP 访问 22 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/erlang/otp/commit/0fcd9c56524b28615e8ece65fc0c3f66ef6e4c12","https://github.com/erlang/otp/commit/6eef04130afc8b0ccb63c9a0d8650209cf54892f","https://github.com/erlang/otp/commit/b1924d37fd83c070055beb115d5d6a6a9490b891","https://github.com/erlang/otp/security/advisories/GHSA-37cp-fgq5-7wc2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/16/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/18/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/18/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/18/6","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/19/1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/04/msg00028.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250425-0001/","https://github.com/ProDefense/CVE-2025-32433/blob/main/CVE-2025-32433.py","https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-erlang-otp-ssh-xyZZy","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-32433","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/code/cves/2025/CVE-2025-32433.yaml","https://github.com/ODST-Forge/CVE-2025-32433_PoC","https://github.com/ProDefense/CVE-2025-32433","https://github.com/omer-efe-curkus/CVE-2025-32433-Erlang-OTP-SSH-RCE-PoC","https://github.com/NiteeshPujari/CVE-2025-32433-PoC","https://github.com/TeneBrae93/CVE-2025-3243","https://github.com/0xPThree/cve-2025-32433","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-32433"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0121","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0121","title":"Palo Alto Networks Cortex XDR Agent 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks Cortex XDR Agent 在 Windows 平台上存在空指针解引用漏洞，低权限的本地 Windows 用户可利用该漏洞使代理程序崩溃。此外，恶意软件可利用此漏洞绕过 Cortex XDR 的检测能力执行恶意活动，影响系统安全监控的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0121"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-04-09","updated":"2025-04-09","remediation":"升级 Cortex XDR Agent 至以下修复版本：8.6.1、8.5.2、8.3.101-CE HF、7.9.103-CE HF 或更高版本。该漏洞无已知的临时规避方案，建议尽快升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2025-0121"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0009","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1974","title":"Kubernetes ingress-nginx 准入控制器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Kubernetes 的 ingress-nginx 准入控制器（Validating Admission Webhook）存在远程代码执行漏洞。在特定条件下，位于 Pod 网络内且无需身份认证的攻击者，可通过向准入控制器暴露的接口发送特制的 AdmissionReview 请求，利用控制器配置校验逻辑中的缺陷注入并执行任意代码，从而在 ingress-nginx 控制器进程上下文中实现远程代码执行。由于默认安装中该控制器可访问集群内全部 Secret，攻击者可借此读取并泄露这些敏感凭据，造成严重的信息泄露与权限提升风险。该漏洞影响未修复的 ingress-nginx 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8（严重）。攻击前提是攻击者能够访问集群的 Pod 网络（如已突破边界进入内部网络或存在暴露的入口）。官方建议升级至 1.12.1 及以上或 1.11.5 及以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1974"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-03-25T00:15:14.753","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:27.847","remediation":"立即将 ingress-nginx 升级至 1.11.5 或 1.12.1 及以上版本（1.10.x 及更早版本无修复需整体升级）。若无法立即升级，应在网络层面限制对准入 Webhook 服务（默认 8443 端口，ValidatingWebhookConfiguration 指向的 Service）的访问，仅允许 kube-apiserver 来源 IP 访问，禁止 Pod 网络或未授权主机直连；同时通过 NetworkPolicy 或防火墙隔离 ingress-nginx 控制器 Pod 的网络，并收紧其 ServiceAccount 权限，避免控制器读取集群内全部 Secret 造成横向泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/131009","https://github.com/B1ack4sh/Blackash-CVE-2025-1974","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250328-0008/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52475","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52338","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1974.yaml","https://github.com/lufeirider/IngressNightmare-PoC","https://github.com/m-q-t/ingressnightmare-detection-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/f7944fe38a3988ee533761e6cdb5e68d67eefff2/ingress-nginx/CVE-2025-1974/README.md","https://github.com/kubernetes/website/blob/2582ebe04be71406110a3960a6d16f991a89921d/content/ja/blog/_posts/2025/ingress-nginx-cve-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1974.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%BA%91%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/Kubernetes%20Ingress-nginx%20admission%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/yandex-cloud/docs/blob/47ef534f5e9072b4d738c6292d74938e29bac8d9/ru/_includes/security/security-bulletins/cve-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1974.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2025-04/Kubernetes%20CVE-2025-1974%20RCE.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/5cf36cd0d4ae46fc3e8539fa2825c78bb5f257c2/data/2025/CVE-2025-1974-zwxxb_CVE-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9f792687ed156d63344016f8bf658946079fb494/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-1974.yaml","https://github.com/hakaioffsec/IngressNightmare-PoC","https://github.com/Esonhugh/ingressNightmare-CVE-2025-1974-exps","https://github.com/sandumjacob/IngressNightmare-POCs","https://github.com/yoshino-s/CVE-2025-1974","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-1974"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0015","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-29927","title":"Vercel Next.js 中间件认证绕过漏洞","description":"Next.js 中间件存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-285/863），攻击者通过在请求中构造恶意的 `x-middleware-subrequest` 请求头，可绕过中间件中的权限检查逻辑，直接访问本应受保护的内部路由。该漏洞影响 Next.js 全系版本（1.11.4 至 12.3.5/13.5.9/14.2.25/15.2.3 之前版本），所有依赖中间件进行鉴权的 Next.js 应用均受影响。CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。修复方式为升级至安全版本或在 Web 服务器层（如 WAF/Nginx）过滤 `x-middleware-subrequest` 请求头。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-29927"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-03-21T15:15:42.660","updated":"2026-06-17T09:05:53.640","remediation":"升级到 Next.js 12.3.5+ / 13.5.9+ / 14.2.25+ / 15.2.3+ 或更高版本；如无法立即升级，在 Nginx/Apache/WAF 层配置规则拦截并删除外部请求中的 `x-middleware-subrequest` 请求头。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/52a078da3884efe6501613c7834a3d02a91676d2","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/5fd3ae8f8542677c6294f32d18022731eab6fe48","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v12.3.5","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v13.5.9","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-f82v-jwr5-mffw","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/23/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/23/4","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250328-0002/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52124","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-29927.yaml","https://github.com/Nayekah/Next.js-Proof-of-Concept","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-29927.md","https://github.com/nu11secur1ty/CVE-mitre/blob/ac449b44513bd2f0f30db8cbb4c005f5fa38861e/2025/CVE-2025-29927/README.MD","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-29927/README.md","https://github.com/AC-UVC/ARL-ADD-POC/blob/6c052f1c7c726184e0c6325dcf3593f358af7b66/poc/CVE-2025-29927.py","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2af0d4e6821c2bba628b60025f4ebdb092ca487e/references/CVE-2025-29927-2025-06-07-1805","https://github.com/moyshik7/vul-detector/blob/a5de9b36f7e5bbb96f345b67a2ed54c204298eeb/cves/CVE-2025-29927.js","https://github.com/Oyst3r1ng/CVE-2025-29927/blob/ce976387acd35f5c6a07783f8531890c3bcd97e7/Poc_CVE-2025-29927.py","https://github.com/ARESHAmohanad/rooms/blob/603aa5bc9064039eefc3af86d1baefb7ba8dfdf1/next.js%20cve-2025-29927.txt","https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset/blob/3cfcb53d9b64f662d864c10bc7a8c2c0a99fe2ea/CHANGES.md","https://github.com/narwalsguy/CVE-and-vuln-fixes/blob/9daa242594c7562cae728afea291a208ddda13c1/CVE-2025-29927%20Next.js","https://github.com/aydinnyunus/CVE-2025-29927","https://github.com/AnonKryptiQuz/NextSploit","https://github.com/websecnl/CVE-2025-29927-PoC-Exploit","https://github.com/6mile/nextjs-CVE-2025-29927","https://github.com/azu/nextjs-cve-2025-29927-poc","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-29927"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0033","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-24813","title":"Apache Tomcat 默认Servlet路径等价远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 默认 Servlet 存在路径等价漏洞（内部点号），当启用写入权限且支持部分 PUT 请求时，未授权攻击者可通过特制的部分 PUT 请求利用路径等价绕过安全检查，导致安全敏感文件泄露或向文件中注入恶意内容。若应用同时使用基于文件的会话持久化且存在反序列化利用库，攻击者可进一步实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 11.0.0-M1 至 11.0.2、10.1.0-M1 至 10.1.34、9.0.0.M1 至 9.0.98 及 8.5.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议升级至 11.0.3、10.1.35 或 9.0.99 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-24813"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-03-10T17:15:35.067","updated":"2026-06-17T08:59:39.593","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 11.0.3 / 10.1.35 / 9.0.99 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，确保 Default Servlet 的 writable 配置为 false（默认关闭），禁用 partial PUT（设置 allowPartialPut=\"false\"），并避免使用文件会话持久化存储到默认路径，同时移除应用中可能被反序列化利用的类库（如 commons-collections 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/j5fkjv2k477os90nczf2v9l61fb0kkgq","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/10/5","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/04/msg00003.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250321-0001/","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-detect-apache-tomcat-rce","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-mitigate-apache-tomcat-rce","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-tomcat-detect-vulnerability","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-tomcat-mitigation-vulnerability","https://github.com/absholi7ly/POC-CVE-2025-24813/blob/main/README.md","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-24813","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52134","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-24813.yaml","https://github.com/Makavellik/POC-CVE-2025-24813-Apache-Tomcat-Remote-Code-Execution","https://github.com/absholi7ly/POC-CVE-2025-24813","https://github.com/iSee857/CVE-2025-24813-PoC","https://github.com/drcrypterdotru/Apache-GOExploiter","https://github.com/mbanyamer/Apache-Tomcat---Remote-Code-Execution-via-Session-Deserialization-CVE-2025-24813-","https://github.com/charis3306/CVE-2025-24813","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-24813"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0022","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-24016","title":"Wazuh Wazuh服务器反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Wazuh 4.4.0 至 4.9.0 版本中存在不安全反序列化漏洞（CWE-502）。攻击者通过 API 向 DistributedAPI 请求/响应注入恶意字典，利用 `as_wazuh_object` 函数在处理 `__unhandled_exc__` 时执行任意 Python 代码，导致远程代码执行。任何具备 API 访问权限的用户（包括被攻破的仪表盘、集群内 Wazuh 服务器，特定配置下甚至被攻破的 Agent）均可触发。CVSS 9.9，危害严重。厂商已在 4.9.1 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-24016"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-02-10T20:15:42.540","updated":"2026-06-17T08:57:53.677","remediation":"立即升级 Wazuh 服务器至 v4.9.1 或更高版本，该版本在 `framework/wazuh/core/cluster/common.py` 中修复了 `as_wazuh_object` 反序列化函数对不可信输入的校验缺陷。在升级前，可在 Wazuh  dashboard 和集群节点间启用严格 API 访问控制（限制 `security/user/authenticate/run_as` 端点的来源 IP），并隔离受损 agent 避免其触发 DAPI 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/security/advisories/GHSA-hcrc-79hj-m3qh","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-24016","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-24016.yaml","https://github.com/celsius026/poc_CVE-2025-24016","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-24016.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/2025/CVE-2025-24016.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-24016.yaml","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/fcd24bcde44c83907fc2e965d2d0edd0cb92051b/modules/exploits/linux/http/wazuh_auth_rce_cve_2025_24016.rb","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/c82e1e98119c564b0325f2c203e3475b09c90003/data/2025/CVE-2025-24016-0xjessie21_CVE-2025-24016.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-24016/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-24016.rules","https://github.com/0xjessie21/CVE-2025-24016/blob/02118546f7a4361e8136cc5ac7079eced88fd646/CVE-2025-24016.py","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2025/CVE-2025-24016.poc","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2025-24016_1.yaml","https://github.com/0xjessie21/CVE-2025-24016","https://github.com/guinea-offensive-security/Wazuh-RCE","https://github.com/MuhammadWaseem29/CVE-2025-24016","https://github.com/huseyinstif/CVE-2025-24016-Nuclei-Template","https://github.com/rxerium/CVE-2025-24016","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-24016"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0134","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0134.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"JeecgBoot 框架 passwordChange 接口任意用户密码重置漏洞","description":"JeecgBoot 是一款基于代码生成器的 Java 企业级低代码开发平台。其 /jeecg-boot/sys/user/passwordChange 接口存在水平越权漏洞，未对当前用户身份与目标用户进行一致性校验，导致未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接构造包含 username 和 newPassword 参数的 HTTP 请求，在无需旧密码或验证码的情况下任意修改包括管理员在内的任意用户密码，从而完全接管系统后台，造成敏感数据泄露和系统控制权丧失。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-01de5c17"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-01-14","updated":"2026-07-22","remediation":"1. 升级 JeecgBoot 至官方已修复版本（≥3.7.0），官方已在后续版本中为 passwordChange 接口添加权限校验注解，确保用户只能修改自身密码；2. 对于无法升级的版本，在 Nginx 或网关层配置访问控制，限制 /jeecg-boot/sys/user/passwordChange 接口仅允许已认证用户访问；3. 在业务代码中增加当前登录用户与会话中 username 的一致性校验，防止水平越权绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.xway.cn/bug/vulnerability.php?id=216"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0134.toml"}]